<title>CHILE: Chile's Andina 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's Andina 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean bottler Embotelladora Andina SA reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>				  1996		1995</p>
<p>Net earnings		   38.46	     32.07</p>
<p>Operating profit	     30.21	     27.63</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	 12.51		7.90</p>
<p>Revenues			143.42	    129.73</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
</text>
